,"digest":"sha256:9a1b69e882c1684503ab2a2ad9b4625014603b36cb09492d7ef047e24a152227","download_count":799,"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:33:18Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:33:20Z"},{"id":667809477,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nzfbF","name":"DBX_0.6.52_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/x-msdownload","state":"uploaded","size":184872208,"digest":"sha256:a2ecd1dde8345955bfae32605e7d27eacdc01d05b218ebeb638c48f38c1d7f48","download_count":9,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:11:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:11:18Z"},{"id":667809476,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nzfbE","name":"DBX_0.6.52_x64-win7-server2012r2-offline-setup.exe.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":118,"digest":"sha256:ead0ebf1b7c3332e24c539fe93a369a1da8464a7d16d4c98741b04f82abaee55","download_count":5,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:11:13Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:11:13Z"},{"id":667792052,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nzbK0","name":"DBX_0.6.52_x64.dmg","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":45194039,"digest":"sha256:204744638de9030687b04aca4d52b87d42b7d61a978b719d91e846b167f73738","download_count":21,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:01:22Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:01:25Z"},{"id":667739920,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nzOcQ","name":"DBX_0.6.52_x64_en-US.msi","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":40382464,"digest":"sha256:c9bf4bcb19871ae4ed1ef611f2f49c3634a9afeb89f85939ae715d2c74cba202","download_count":26,"created_at":"2026-10-23T02:33:15Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T02:33:17Z"},{"id":667792216,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nzbNY","name":"DBX_x64.app.tar.gz","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/zip","state":"uploaded","size":45181525,"digest":"sha256:b53829740bdea232c404b0c69aef205c23a560ab700fd46aedf771542b7a909b","download_count":43,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:01:25Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:01:28Z"},{"id":667828711,"node_id":"RA_kwDOSPdiBc4nzkHn","name":"latest.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":19048,"digest":"sha256:5397541895b85e7efe247b86f785e466ccc5a32c38b436a9c05af330009b1548","download_count":3059,"created_at":"2026-10-23T03:21:02Z","updated_at":"2026-10-23T03:21:02Z"}],"body":"### 新功能\n\n- 表数据页底部 SQL 可点击打开对话框，完整查看、复制或临时编辑，并可将草稿一键打开到独立的新查询标签页 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#13187](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13187))\n- SSH 隧道认证支持按指纹选择 ssh-agent 中的指定密钥，并遵循 ~/.ssh/config 的 IdentitiesOnly/IdentityFile 设置，agent 内密钥较多时不再因超出服务器认证次数上限而连接失败 (contributed by @wzw1990) (PR [#13157](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13157))\n- Redis 键详情新增插件解码选项，可选择已安装的解码插件，把应用特定的二进制值在本面板内显示为 JSON 或文本 (contributed by @Chow-Code) (PR [#13154](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13154))\n- SQL 补全新增 CockroachDB 专属的关键字与函数支持 (contributed by @Pius-x) (PR [#13169](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13169))\n- SQL 补全新增 Spanner 的关键字与函数支持 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#13136](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13136))\n- 查询工具栏的连接选择器显示连接的完整分组路径，鼠标悬浮连接名称可预览连接详情 (contributed by @hanxuanyu) (PR [#13155](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13155))\n\n### 改进\n\n- 侧边栏多选表行改用持续的蓝色高亮和内嵌标记，焦点移出树或配置连接色后依然清晰可辨 (contributed by @heeeex100) (PR [#13113](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13113))\n- 多语句执行摘要的进度条和表格铺满整个结果面板，不再只挤在左侧留出大片空白 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#13188](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13188))\n- 移除结果区域外圈的连接色描边，保留连接色点等标识，配置鲜艳连接色时视觉更柔和 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#13195](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13195))\n- 分组标签选中态只保留一条分组色底线，非活动标签底线弱化、分组标题文字改用中性色，多个彩色分组里更易辨认 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#13196](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13196))\n- MySQL 补全补齐 SHOW BINARY LOGS、SHOW BINLOG EVENTS 语句和 REGEXP/RLIKE 运算符 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13133](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13133))\n- 侧边栏表搜索复用内存和持久化索引缓存，不再每次搜索都重新加载对象树，搜索更快也不会反复闪断 (contributed by @poncosh) (PR [#13062](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13062))\n\n### 修复\n\n- Linux：MCP 状态检测调用用户 shell 时改为在独立进程会话中执行，交互式 shell 无法再通过终端作业控制挂起 DBX 进程 (contributed by @hoangph-34) (PR [#13198](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13198))\n- PostgreSQL：导出表 DDL 将标准命名序列的 nextval 默认值还原为 serial/bigserial 类型，恢复建表不再因序列缺失而失败 (contributed by @dienaso) (PR [#13112](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13112))\n- 开启「自动保留查询结果」后，刷新、自动刷新、翻页和数据库排序在当前结果标签页原地更新，不再每次都新增结果标签不断堆积 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#13178](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13178))\n- Linux：新增「窗口透明效果」设置，透明边框导致窗口频闪（如 Fedora）时可将其关闭，应用并重启后生效 (contributed by @AspBamboo) (PR [#12975](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12975))\n- Redis：兼容 TongRDS 等对 GETRANGE 越界严格拒绝的内核，String 键详情不再空白，读取失败时面板会显示原因并提供重试 (contributed by @Gaiokane) (PR [#13123](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13123))\n- 设置导出导入覆盖明暗主题模式和桌面偏好（托盘图标、关闭行为、图标主题等），备份往返不再丢失这些设置 (contributed by @caiyq925-cell) (PR [#13186](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13186))\n- jdbc 通用连接上的 DuckDB：不再下发 DuckDB JDBC 不支持的 loginTimeout/connectTimeout 属性，连接不再建立失败 (contributed by @heeeex100) (PR [#13161](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13161))\n- SQL 文件面板新增文件、重命名或刷新后保持当前滚动位置，不再跳回顶部 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13124](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13124))\n- SQL Server：编辑视图保存时正确改写带前导注释的源码为 ALTER VIEW，不再生成 ALTER 与 CREATE 并存而无法执行的脚本 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13125](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13125))\n- 「多语句执行默认视图」改回数据表后，再次执行多条查询不再被强制切回摘要页 (contributed by @eryajf) (PR [#13127](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13127))\n- 补全中与输入完全匹配的候选（如 sel 匹配 select * 片段）排在置顶序列之前，Tab 不再误插入序列名 (contributed by @yiqiui) (PR [#13132](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13132))\n- Kafka：消费组列表加载整体受单一截止时间约束，部分协调器缓慢时不再拖死后续 Topics 请求和整个连接 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#13139](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13139))\n- 达梦：中文 Windows 上按 GBK 解码 dexp/dimp 输出，导入失败时能看到工具自身的错误原因，不再只有退出码提示 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#13143](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13143))\n- MySQL：结果导出前重放批次中的 SET @用户变量语句，「导出全部」不再因导出会话缺少变量而产出空文件 (contributed by @thailoc-dev) (PR [#13144](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13144))\n- AI 助手：聊天中选择数据库后模型返回的 SQL 固定在该库上执行，不再回落到连接的默认库 (contributed by @Abeautifulsnow) (PR [#13182](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13182))\n- SQL Server：结果行数达到上限后立即停止读取并放弃剩余结果流，只取前几百行的大结果集查询不再耗时十几秒 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#13101](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13101))\n- Windows：启动时区分 WebView2 运行时缺失/损坏与安全软件拦截，缺失或损坏时引导安装离线包，拦截场景改用有界兼容启动阶梯逐级重试，不再一律误判为杀软拦截 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#13036](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13036))\n- macOS：更新后「重启 DBX」改经 LaunchServices 打开应用包，修复重启后所有局域网数据库连接报 No route to host 的问题 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#13135](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13135))\n- MySQL：取消查询、兼容驱动元数据、对象源码等剩余路径的超时遵循连接配置，不再固定 5 秒 (contributed by @zipg) (PR [#13100](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13100))\n- Hologres：无主键表的定位器降级覆盖首次单击打开与刷新路径，单击表不再报错 (contributed by @ericbyz) (PR [#13007](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13007))\n- 数据对比同步插入后重置自增序列（PostgreSQL setval、SQL Server IDENTITY_INSERT），同步后的普通插入不再主键冲突 (contributed by @BrydonJ) (PR [#12760](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12760))\n- PostgreSQL：连接配置的 search_path 含连字符等标识符时正确加引号，连接不再因此建立失败 (contributed by @lcq928) (PR [#13165](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13165))\n- 光标停在表别名点号后（如 WHERE u.）时也能异步拉取列候选，列补全不再时灵时不灵 (contributed by @ericbyz) (PR [#13162](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13162))\n- PostgreSQL/openGauss/GaussDB：数据库注释改从共享目录读取，执行 COMMENT ON DATABASE 后对象浏览器能正常显示注释 (contributed by @Acd-kk) (PR [#13094](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/13094))\n- MariaDB：UUID 列以可读文本显示和编辑，不再显示十六进制串且保存报 Incorrect UUID value (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#12920](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/12920))\n- WebDAV 自动上传记住上次上传时间，未到间隔就关闭应用不再重置倒计时导致自动上传永不触发 (contributed by @lxk955) (PR [#11921](https://github.com/t8y2/dbx/pull/11921))\n\n### 赞助信息\n\n- HuaLongAI（华龙算力）国模百亿补贴：DeepSeek等模型低至 0.8 折，谷价 0.4 折，GPT 模型不降智 0.15 倍率，[注册入口](https://dbx.hualong.online/)\n\n---\n<!-- dbx-cnb-mirror -->\n> 国内下载：如果 GitHub 下载较慢，可从 [CNB 镜像](https://cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx/-/releases/tag/v0.6.52) 下载桌面端安装包，Docker 镜像从 `docker.cnb.cool/dbxio.com/dbx:v0.6.52` 拉取。\n","mentions_count":21}
